  "title": {
    "zh": "两站镜片封箱",
    "en": "Separate the Lens Shipments"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "红站领 7 枚镜片，蓝站领 5 枚。两站不能混箱，每个标准托盘最多放 3 枚，必须用最少的托盘。每盘放 2 个缓冲垫并贴 1 道新封签；每个目的站共用 1 张地址卡。所有镜片装齐，超宽托盘和旧封签都不合规。审核 AI 每次发来的整单。",
    "en": "Red Station needs 7 lenses and Blue Station needs 5. A standard tray holds at most 3 lenses, and destinations cannot share a tray. Use the fewest trays. Fit two cushions and one fresh seal to every tray. Each destination shares a single address card. Ship all lenses and leave out oversized trays and used seals. Audit every revised manifest."
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "按目的地向上取整、按盘与按站计件",
    "en": "Separate rounding by destination, per-tray and per-site counts"
  },
